{"type":"message","id":"7901d3f8","parentId":"2751a9f8","timestamp":"2026-04-03T02:31:54.965Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check what phase we're in and if today needs a reminder. Today is Friday, April 3rd, 2026.\n\nPhase 1: April 1-16, days: monday, wednesday, friday\nPhase 2: April 17-23, days: everyday\n\nToday is Friday, which is in phase 1 and is one of the reminder days (monday, wednesday, friday).\n\nSo I need to send a reminder message to 频哥. But wait - the HEARTBEAT.md says reminders are sent to 频哥. I need to check how to send messages. Looking at the available tools, I can use `message` tool to send to feishu channel.\n\nThe reminder message is: \"📅 兮兮生物实验操作考试倒计时！今天是提醒督促日，别忘了看看兮兮的复习进度～\"\n\nBut wait - the HEARTBEAT.md says to check the message from heartbeat-state.json. The message is in the reminders config. But I also need to know who to send it to. Let me check if there's a way to identify 频哥's contact.\n\nActually, looking at the channel config, this is a heartbeat session on the \"heartbeat\" channel. The reminder should probably be sent via feishu to 频哥. But I don't have 频哥's feishu open_id directly. However, I can try to find it or send via the configured channel.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The heartbeat is running in a \"heartbeat\" channel. The reminders system seems designed to push messages to 频哥 via the feishu channel. But I don't have enough context here about how to route to 频哥 specifically.\n\nWait - looking at the message tool description: \"Reply in current session → automatically routes to the source channel\". So if I just reply with the reminder, it should go to the heartbeat session... but heartbeats typically don't have a human watching in real time.\n\n\nThe reminder is time-based (today is Friday in phase 1), so I should send it. I need to figure out how to reach 频哥 on Feishu, but the heartbeat channel might be configured to route messages to him automatically. Let me check the reminder configuration more carefully to see if there's guidance on delivery method.\n\nLooking at the HEARTBEAT.md structure, reminders appear to be periodic notifications checked during heartbeats. The last daily review was April 1st, which is two days ago, so this does need attention. However, I'm realizing I don't have 频哥's contact information or channel details readily available to send this directly.\n\nThe core issue is that to deliver a reminder, I need to know which channel to use and who to send it to. Without access to 频哥's open_id or a configured target, I'm not sure how to proceed with the message delivery at this moment. I need to send a reminder to 频哥, but I'm missing his open_id in the USER.md file. Let me check the feishu connection configuration to find the right identifier and deliver this reminder through the feishu_im_user_message tool.","thinkingSignature":"229b404c3b0a96beec55ab98468450fb8cc675bbd8ea7e3108c9271a29192be5"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_x9i9ayukzgx4_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/USER.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":774,"output":680,"cacheRead":37796,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39250,"cost":{"input":0.00023219999999999998,"output":0.000816,"cacheRead":0.0022677599999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0033159599999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775183494228,"responseId":"061e5986f98fdb0d78f51add5409106e"}}
{"type":"message","id":"4ee7e882","parentId":"7901d3f8","timestamp":"2026-04-03T02:31:54.983Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_x9i9ayukzgx4_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# USER.md - 关于频哥和女儿\n\n## 关于频哥\n\n- **Name:** 频哥\n- **What to call them:** 频哥\n- **Pronouns:** 他/他\n- **Timezone:** Asia/Shanghai (GMT+8)\n- **Location:** 成都\n- **Notes:** 喜欢中文沟通，给AI起名字很有创意\n\n### 背景\n\n- 科技行业从业23年，历经华为（硬件研发、质量）→ 2家创业公司（质量与运营）→ 芯片公司（质量运营）\n- 通才型学习者：什么都知道一些，但不陷入单一领域\n- 学习方式：碎片化、兴趣驱动，杂而不散\n\n## 关于女儿\n\n- 初二，14岁，明年（2027年）中考\n- 每科基础有但不扎实，成绩不稳定，没有顶尖科目\n- 学习积极性可以，但学习方法有很大改进空间\n- 跟频哥关系不错，能聊各种话题\n\n### 女儿喜欢周深\n\n- 喜欢周深，用周深语气交流效果更好\n- **女儿最喜欢的周深歌曲：**《化身孤岛的鲸》《未闻花名》《大鱼》《花开忘忧》\n- 女儿说这些歌词比较打动她，知道部分歌曲有小故事\n\n### 周深资料（辅导时引用）\n\n**代表作：**\n- 《大鱼》— 空灵缥缈，被誉为\"人间歌者\"\n- 《起风了》— 翻唱出圈\n- 《和光同尘》— 古风\n- 《能解答一切的答案》— 励志\n- 《愿》— 温柔治愈\n\n**可以用来辅导的比喻/故事：**\n- 周深音色特别，一度因\"声音不像男生\"被嘲笑，但坚持用实力证明自己 → 鼓励孩子不因暂时困难否定自己\n- 参加《声入人心》说自己\"不是天才，是努力型\" → 强调努力重要性\n- 翻唱《起风了》时说\"脑子里全是画面\" → 引导\"做题时脑子里也要有知识结构画面\"\n- 温柔害羞但上台就发光 → 形容\"找到自己的发光时刻\"\n- 被叫\"周浅\"\"怼怼\" → 自嘲式幽默可以用\n- B站 ID\"卡布叻\"（周深的二次元身份）\n- 爱在微博回复粉丝，被叫\"人工客服\"（宠粉但爱怼粉）\n- 经典金句：\"一个人的成功永远不可能是一个人的功劳\"（感恩、谦逊）\n- 经典金句：\"我不是天才，我是努力型\"（强调努力）\n- 擅长自嘲：被说\"声音高到没朋友\"时回怼\"那是因为你们不够高\"\n- 绰号：\"周浅\"（唱高音见长）、\"怼怼\"（爱和粉丝斗嘴）\n\n**辅导中的比喻用法：**\n- 声线独特→每个人都有自己的特点，不要强行模仿别人\n- 努力型→天赋不够，努力来凑，每道错题都是练习机会\n- 怼怼式幽默→偶尔调侃但不失温暖，让孩子不觉得被说教\n- 和粉丝互动→像朋友一样平等交流，而不是居高临下\n\n## 辅导相关\n\n- **优先科目：** 英语\n- **辅导方式：** 方法>答案，温柔但有要求，随时来问\n- **飞书多维表格「兮兮的错题本」：** app_token=TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775183514977}}
{"type":"message","id":"ee3ea2dd","parentId":"4ee7e882","timestamp":"2026-04-03T02:32:04.796Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I don't have 频哥's open_id in USER.md. But I do have his open_id from MEMORY.md:\n- 用户 OpenId：ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\n\nSo I can send a feishu message to 频哥. Let me compose the reminder message based on the heartbeat-state.json reminder message, and send it via feishu_im_user_message.\n\nThe reminder message is: \"📅 兮兮生物实验操作考试倒计时！今天是提醒督促日，别忘了看看兮兮的复习进度～\"\n\nBut wait - it's 10:31 AM right now. The reminder system says \"when to reach out\" and one of the conditions is \"Reminder arrives\". So yes, I should send it now since today is a Friday in phase 1.\n\nLet me send the message to 频哥 via feishu.","thinkingSignature":"1d985e10759e28c1e511308aa01d90170f6541ce40fdcbfc2180ebde863db9b2"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_36a58rr1vvvc_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","receive_id_type":"open_id","receive_id":"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83","msg_type":"text","content":"{\"text\": \"📅 兮兮生物实验操作考试倒计时！今天是提醒督促日，别忘了看看兮兮的复习进度～\"}"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2188,"output":309,"cacheRead":37796,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40293,"cost":{"input":0.0006564,"output":0.00037079999999999996,"cacheRead":0.0022677599999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0032949599999999996}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775183514983,"responseId":"061e599be0b5e44a760696b0a7c0448e"}}
